    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Azure Blob Storage on IoT Edge now provides integration with Event Grid on IoT Edge (in preview), enabling other modules to react to events such as creation and deletion of blobs locally.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/event-grid/edge/react-blob-storage-events-locally\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Azure Blob Storage on IoT Edge now provides integration with Event Grid on IoT Edge (in preview), enabling other modules to react to events such as creation and deletion of blobs locally.\n\nLearn more ."
  },
